    In other cases, a message is blocked the rt time it arrives at a node on an f-ring (for example, node <span data-field="node_id_2">{{ node_id_2 }}</span> for a WE message in Figure 3). In such cases, a message may use clockwise or counter clockwise orientation depending on other conditions. The orientations and conditions are given in Table 2.
